that made him get arrested.

00:56:31.360 --> 00:56:34.963
Police Brutality Viewed
Thru Stained Glass Windows.

00:56:38.000 --> 00:56:40.900
For more than two centuries
are foreparents labored

00:56:40.900 --> 00:56:42.913
