00:57:24.600 --> 00:57:27.770
and when I cried out
with my mother's grief,

00:57:27.770 --> 00:57:29.300
none but Jesus heard me.

00:57:29.300 --> 00:57:30.927
And ain't I a woman?

00:57:30.927 --> 00:57:34.490
'Cause when they said
all men are created equal

00:57:34.490 --> 00:57:36.163
I added and women?

00:57:37.530 --> 00:57:39.360
Ain't I a Woman?

