Speech presented by Sojourner
Truth in 1851 in Akron, Ohio.

00:57:45.980 --> 00:57:48.113
This was so fun to do.

00:57:49.800 --> 00:57:53.503
and there is a painting.

00:57:54.370 --> 00:57:55.203
Okay.

