Understanding this what could I say.

00:58:14.640 --> 00:58:17.160
Also Absolute Tyranny.

00:58:17.160 --> 00:58:19.340
What was going on?

00:58:19.340 --> 00:58:24.340
A lot with the people
hanging from the trees.

00:58:26.960 --> 00:58:29.560
Taxes On Us Without Our Consent.

00:58:32.020 --> 00:58:33.123
Taxes On Us.

00:58:36.490 --> 00:58:37.763
Oh my goodness.

00:58:39.550 --> 00:58:43.143
We Have Appealed to Their
Native Justice and Magnanimity.

00:58:45.720 --> 00:58:46.863
Frederick Douglass.

00:58:54.070 --> 00:58:55.940
I was brought up to understand that

00:58:55.940 --> 00:59:00.090
in America my freedom was
not more than a promise

00:59:00.090 --> 00:59:01.350
that would be a struggle

00:59:01.350 --> 00:59:05.383
