00:59:06.640 --> 00:59:11.303
These are all things
I really wanted to do.

00:59:14.620 --> 00:59:16.473
Yes we can and we did.

00:59:17.420 --> 00:59:18.253
Yeah.

00:59:20.110 --> 00:59:25.110
It's too bad we couldn't have
our first woman president

00:59:26.720 --> 00:59:31.720
maybe we wouldn't have so many
problems like we have today.

00:59:33.755 --> 00:59:36.922
