00:59:42.830 --> 00:59:45.145
Somebody didn't do it I did.

00:59:45.145 --> 00:59:46.400
I went and voted for her.

00:59:46.400 --> 00:59:48.473
No, I did, I'm sorry.

00:59:49.510 --> 00:59:53.683
I voted for her, and I voted
for him, I voted for her.

00:59:55.280 --> 00:59:56.523
Unfortunately.

00:59:59.050 --> 01:00:00.197
Yes indeed.

01:00:03.360 --> 01:00:08.360
Now this is a sculptor who
