'em to him, of Obama.

01:00:19.270 --> 01:00:22.121
I'm wondering you know
just has he ever seen this?

01:00:22.121 --> 01:00:23.110
(audience laughing)

01:00:23.110 --> 01:00:26.030
Well you don't know, I
don't know what he did.

01:00:27.410 --> 01:00:29.270
Flag Stories.

01:00:29.270 --> 01:00:34.143
Now the Flag Stories I did
because I woke up one morning

01:00:36.210 --> 01:00:41.210
and they were planes
flying into these buildings

01:00:41.870 --> 01:00:45.010
and I thought it was some
kind of advertisement

01:00:45.010 --> 01:00:45.843
but it wasn't.

01:00:45.843 --> 01:00:46.676
It was 9/11.

01:00:49.620 --> 01:00:53.230
On Tuesday morning we
faced the devil in the sky

01:00:53.230 --> 01:00:55.993
and told him that freedom will never die.

01:00:57.028 --> 01:00:59.210
And I just I couldn't believe I was seeing

01:00:59.210 --> 01:01:03.410
what I was seeing and I
just kept doing these flags

01:01:03.410 --> 01:01:05.713
'cause I was just overwhelmed.

01:01:08.140 --> 01:01:09.713
Oh my goodness.

01:01:12.880 --> 01:01:13.980
I couldn't believe it.

01:01:15.780 --> 01:01:18.700
My darling we are facing
the devil in the sky.

01:01:18.700 --> 01:01:23.660
A hateful man with a what a terrible plan

01:01:25.850 --> 01:01:27.900
that all of us shall die.

01:01:27.900 --> 01:01:30.693
Oh my this was such a frightening morning.

01:01:31.910 --> 01:01:36.563
On Tuesday morning you called
me from the burning sky,

01:01:37.830 --> 01:01:42.730
you're searing words of
pain will forever remain

01:01:42.730 --> 01:01:44.350
encrusted in my heart.

01:01:44.350 --> 01:01:47.090
My darling we are facing
the devil in the sky,

01:01:47.090 --> 01:01:49.260
a hateful man with a hellish plan

01:01:49.260 --> 01:01:50.773
for all of us to die.

01:01:51.670 --> 01:01:53.250
There is a mountain in every valley

01:01:53.250 --> 01:01:55.770
but is there a safe haven in the sky?

01:01:55.770 --> 01:01:57.750
If so we will try.

01:01:57.750 --> 01:02:00.360
If not my darling I love you goodbye.

01:02:00.360 --> 01:02:02.660
That was a horrible morning

01:02:05.230 --> 01:02:08.130
when these people were dying

01:02:08.130 --> 01:02:09.650
when these planes and

01:02:11.070 --> 01:02:13.550
oh my God it was too much.

01:02:13.550 --> 01:02:14.383
A lot.

01:02:16.010 --> 01:02:20.093
Tuesday morning 9/11.

01:02:20.093 --> 01:02:22.720
Hope that never happens again.

01:02:22.720 --> 01:02:24.160
I just kept making flags.

01:02:24.160 --> 01:02:25.660
I didn't know what else to do.

01:02:32.670 --> 01:02:34.990
Well, well do tell, 9/11.

01:02:34.990 --> 01:02:37.610
Suicide bombers in heaven?

01:02:37.610 --> 01:02:41.630
We think not, heaven's
not where they're at.

01:02:41.630 --> 01:02:45.080
There's been a huge mistake
but for heaven's sake

01:02:45.080 --> 01:02:46.473
what's a little sin?

01:02:47.560 --> 01:02:51.593
We'll get you in and we can
double date 'em in hell.

01:02:53.940 --> 01:02:58.183
Yeah the idea of that whole
thing was just cuckoo.

01:03:03.240 --> 01:03:04.073
Freedom Flag.

01:03:14.170 --> 01:03:19.170
So you're the 19 men
we've been waiting for?

01:03:19.170 --> 01:03:24.110
Well I'm the devil and here's
what hell has in store,

01:03:24.110 --> 01:03:26.850
90 bitches on a bed of coals

01:03:26.850 --> 01:03:31.850
and a million hags with tortured souls.

01:03:31.920 --> 01:03:35.230
Serial killers, assassins,
rapists, murderers and more

01:03:36.270 --> 01:03:41.270
with an eternity of time
for you to enjoy and enjoy.

01:03:41.400 --> 01:03:44.050
And that's what happened on 9/11

01:03:44.050 --> 01:03:47.973
when 19 suicide bombers went to hell.

01:03:56.120 --> 01:03:58.199
- Backwards.
- Oh, I'm sorry.

01:03:58.199 --> 01:03:59.890
(woman chattering)

01:03:59.890 --> 01:04:02.453
Yeah this was oh this was such a day.

01:04:03.480 --> 01:04:04.423
This is too much.

01:04:08.666 --> 01:04:09.866
They just couldn't stop.

01:04:10.910 --> 01:04:14.570
I couldn't believe it and then
after I began to believe it,

01:04:14.570 --> 01:04:17.200
I couldn't stop doing it

01:04:19.313 --> 01:04:21.063
and I made this series for the ACLU

01:04:23.502 --> 01:04:26.153
of posters channel 13 and okay.

01:04:28.824 --> 01:04:32.288
